       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Daily total:** 3000 mg three times daily is 9,000 mg/day. The usual maximum for an adult is 4,000 mg/day, and many institutions cap it at 3,000 mg/day. 9,000 mg/day is in the range that can cause serious hepatotoxicity, even with normal liver function.\n- **Single dose:** 3000 mg is also well above the typical single dose of 500\u20131000 mg.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **1000 mg PO three times daily** (3,000 mg/day)\n- **650 mg PO every 6 hours** (2,600 mg/day)\n- **1000 mg PO every 6 hours** (4,000 mg/day, the maximum)\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it. If you really do intend 3000 mg three times daily, please confirm that and give me the clinical rationale for the order note. I'd still advise checking with pharmacy first."
